; ntdll.def - exports used by the FreexComp RTL. Source: learn.microsoft.com (function reference pages).
; __C_specific_handler is the SEH personality routine (ABI-161). __chkstk is never listed: the compiler emits it (RTL-065).
LIBRARY ntdll.dll
EXPORTS
RtlGetVersion
__C_specific_handler
